Give supervisor check-ins server time

Supervisor checks can run after the parent thread is unloaded and no
client is subscribed. Reading an external client clock during helper
creation or inference prevents such cold wakes from reaching a model
turn.

Use app-server UTC for each helper spawn and disable the helper's
inherited current-time reminder. Interactive time requests still use
the configured session clock; only unattended supervisor check-ins
stop depending on client presence.
